{% include "@components/header-prototypes/header-ccid.twig" %}
<section class="hero bleed blur img-fill full">
    <img src="../../images/CCID/ccid-info-1.jpg" alt="doctor typing on laptop">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell large-7 small-12">
                <h1>Participants & Community</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="cell large-5 small-12">
                <img src="../../images/CCID/ccid-info-1.jpg" alt="doctor typing on laptop">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% include "@components/navigation-prototypes/navbar-ccid.twig" %}
<section class="bleed">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x ">
            <main class="cell small-12 medium-8 large-8">
        <ul class="accordion" data-accordion data-allow-all-closed="true">
            <li class="accordion-item is-active" data-accordion-item>
                <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>What is clinical research?</strong></a>
                <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                    <p>Clinical research studies health and disease in people to discover new ways to prevent, diagnose, and treat medical conditions.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Why should I consider participating?</strong></a>
                <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                    <p>By joining a study, you help advance science and improve health in your community. Many participants also gain access to new treatments and closer health monitoring.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>How is my safety protected?</strong></a>
                <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                    <p>All studies are carefully reviewed by an ethics board and monitored by trained medical staff. Your safety and privacy are always our top priority.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Will I be compensated?</strong></a>
                <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                    <p>Many studies offer compensation for your time, travel, or other expenses. Details vary by study.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                <a href="#" class="accordion-title"><strong>Can I stop participating once I start?</strong></a>
                <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                    <p>Yes. Participation is completely voluntary, and you may withdraw at any time without affecting your regular medical care.</p>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="margin-top"><em><strong>Want more details? Visit our <a>Full FAQ page</a> for answers to additional questions.</em></strong></p>
            </main>
            <aside class="cell small-12 medium-6 large-4">
            <a class="callout color orange flex-child-auto">
            <span class="fa-stack fa-2x">
                <i class="fas fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i>
                <i class="fas fa-search fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i>
            </span>
            <h3 class="h4">Current Research Studies</h3>
        </a>
        <a class="callout color blue flex-child-auto">
            <span class="fa-stack fa-2x">
                <i class="fas fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i>
                <i class="fas fa-envelope fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i>
            </span>
            <h3 class="h4">Contact Us</h3>
        </a>
        <div class="callout contact outline">
            <h5>Sign up for our quarterly newsletter for research updates, new study opportunities, and more!</h5>
            <form>
                <label>Email Address
                    <input type="text" class="small-4">
                </label>
                <button type="submit" class="button">Subscribe me!</button>
         </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
